<title>USA: Garland, Texas, $11.930 mln won by Merrill Lynch. [CORRECTED 20:57 GMT]</title>
<headline>Garland, Texas, $11.930 mln won by Merrill Lynch. [CORRECTED 20:57 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co said it won $11.930 million of Garland, Texas, combination limited tax and revenue certificates of obligation, series 1997A, with a net interest cost of 5.38 (corrects from 5.36) percent.</p>
</text>
